OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects released on bail,
OL,4,Ahead of counter-terror police says
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,8,FSunday are being released on bail, says
OL,9,Fthe head of UK counter terrorism
OL,10,Fpolicing
OL,12,FAssistant Commissioner Laurence Taylor
OL,13,Fsays the investigation is not over, and
OL,14,Fpolice are considering numerous angles,
OL,15,Fincluding whether proxies working on
OL,16,Fbehalf of a foreign state could have
OL,17,Fbeen involved
OL,19,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,20,Fwho live in London - were arrested
OL,21,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,22,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
