OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects released on bail,
OL,4,Ahead of counter-terror police says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounter-terror police say they are
OL,7,F"very aware of the levels of
OL,8,Fspeculation about the motivation behind
OL,9,Fthis incident, and the geopolitical
OL,10,Fquestions that are being raised". The
OL,11,FIranian embassy in the UK denies any
OL,12,Finvolvement
OL,14,FMeanwhile, Home Secretary Shabana
OL,15,FMahmood says that the scene is safe and
OL,16,Fresidents will soon be allowed to
OL,17,Freturn home
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
