OL,3,ASeoul summons Ukraine envoy over North
OL,4,AKorean prisoner-of-war row
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Korea has summoned Ukraine's
OL,7,Facting ambassador after President
OL,8,FVolodymyr Zelensky last week announced
OL,9,Fhis government had transferred two
OL,10,Fcaptured North Korean soldiers to
OL,11,FSeoul.
OL,13,FVice Foreign Minister Park Yoon-joo
OL,14,Flodged a formal complaint with Andrii
OL,15,FVieshkin and expressed "strong regret"
OL,16,Fthat Zelensky had revealed the
OL,17,Ftransfer, which Seoul says was supposed
OL,18,Fto be a secret.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
